{"cues":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":15.68},{"sectionId":"build","start":17,"end":34.32},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.64,"end":47.12}],"captions":[{"sectionId":"concept","start":0,"end":2.64,"text":"一局遊戲是一連串狀態轉換。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":3.2,"end":6.88,"text":"順序很重要：拿鑰匙之前試著開門，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":7.36,"end":9.04,"text":"門應仍上鎖。"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":9.44,"end":12.56,"text":"run 函式每次都從新狀態開始，"},{"sectionId":"concept","start":12.96,"end":15.68,"text":"避免兩條路線意外共用物品。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":17,"end":17.92,"text":"在 /chapter4."},{"sectionId":"build","start":18.16,"end":20.08,"text":"py 的 actions 串列中，"},{"sectionId":"build","start":20.4,"end":25.6,"text":"把單一 open door 改為先 take key、再 open door。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":26.32,"end":30.16,"text":"執行後比較 escaped 狀態與前一條路線。"},{"sectionId":"build","start":31.56,"end":34.32,"text":"為什麼 run 每次都要建立新狀態？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":35.64,"end":38.48,"text":"為什麼 run 每次都要建立新狀態？"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":39.76,"end":43.76,"text":"請根據剛才測試的模型或程式選擇答案。"},{"sectionId":"checkpoint","start":44.4,"end":47.12,"text":"回饋會說明不同選項的差異。"}]}